6-10-22T14:06:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:07:01Z"}],"body":"### enhancements\n\n- allow set twm layout per monitor and per workspace.\n- allow hide pause message on wallpapers.\n\n### fix\n\n- per-app volume sessions not showing in the media volume mixer.\n- network api crashing when no connected to any network.\n- system tray not showing any icon on Windows 10, and icons without registry entry being ignored on Windows 11.\n\n## What's Changed\n* build(deps): bump @tauri-apps/api from 2.12.1 to 2.12.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1924\n* build(deps-dev): bump svelte from 5.57.1 to 5.57.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1919\n* build(deps): bump preact-render-to-string from 6.7.0 to 6.8.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1923\n* build(deps-dev): bump react-i18next from 17.0.15 to 17.0.16 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1925\n* build(deps-dev): bump express from 5.2.1 to 5.3.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1920\n* build(deps): bump tauri-plugin-updater from 2.13.0 to 2.13.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1921\n* fix(clock): resync the date tick on every update by @z1pp090 in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1909\n* build(deps-dev): bump follow-redirects from 1.16.0 to 1.16.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1929\n* i18n: overhaul and polish Vietnamese localization by @chusaubanh in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1927\n* build(deps): bump @dnd-kit/react from 0.5.0 to 0.5.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1931\n* build(deps): bump @dnd-kit/svelte from 0.5.0 to 0.5.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1930\n* build(deps): bump dompurify from 3.4.16 to 3.4.17 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1934\n* build(deps): bump preact-render-to-string from 6.8.0 to 6.8.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1936\n* build(deps): bump arc-swap from 1.9.2 to 1.9.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1935\n* build(deps): bump tokio from 1.53.1 to 1.53.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1938\n\n## New Contributors\n* @chusaubanh made their first contribution in https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/pull/1927\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/eythaann/Seelen-UI/compare/v2.8.9...v2.8.10","reactions":{"total_count":7,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":6,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":3}
